tainer variants.\n\n#### 4. Interactive Components & Micro-Interactions\n* **[`button.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/button.tsx)**: Framer Motion spring physics with `whileTap={{ scale: 0.97 }}` and `whileHover={{ scale: 1.01 }}`. Variants: `primary`, `secondary`, `luxury`, `crimson`, `outline`, `ghost`, `glass`, with icon slots and loading states.\n* **[`card.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/card.tsx)**: Obsidian surface cards, `MetricCard` with live status beacons, and hover elevation cards.\n* **[`input.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/input.tsx)**: Text inputs with left/right icon slots and shortcut badges (`⌘K`).\n* **[`select.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/select.tsx)**: Dark automotive dropdown select with custom chevron.\n* **[`slider.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/slider.tsx)**: Automotive range slider with custom track fill and live value readouts.\n* **[`switch.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/switch.tsx)**: Tactile toggle switch with animated spring notch.\n* **[`badge.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/badge.tsx)**: Status chips, `LiveBadge` with pulsing radar ping, and `SpecTag` (e.g. `MAKE: Porsche`).\n* **[`section.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/section.tsx)** & **[`container.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/container.tsx)**: `Section`, `SectionHeader` with eyebrow labels and actions, and responsive layout `Grid`.\n\n#### 5. Loading & Error States\n* **[`skeleton.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/skeleton.tsx)**: `CarCardSkeleton` for catalog loading and `SpecGridSkeleton` for telemetry.\n* **[`spinner.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/spinner.tsx)**: Automotive HUD / Radar spinner with rotating outer ring and pulsing core.\n* **[`alert.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/alert.tsx)**: Dismissable alert banners (`info`, `warning`, `error`, `success`).\n* **[`empty-state.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/empty-state.tsx)**: Cinematic zero-result recovery component with action button.\n\n#### 6. Interactive Design System Showcase\n* **[`app/page.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/page.tsx)**: Interactive showcase displaying every typography level, color token, button variant, card layout, input/slider/switch control, badge, skeleton loader, and error state with live state.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n- **TypeScript Typecheck (`npx tsc --noEmit`)**: **0 errors**.\n- **Next.js Production Build (`npm run build`)**: **Compiled successfully with all static pages optimized**.\n\nDetails are documented in the [Walkthrough Artifact](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/brain/10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1/walkthrough.md)."}
