{"step_index":236,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T19:17:58Z","content":"# AutoMind AI — Navbar Implemented\n\nThe **AutoMind AI Navbar** is implemented and integrated into the global application layout (`frontend/app/layout.tsx`).\n\n---\n\n### Key Features Implemented\n\n#### 1. Branding & Header Structure\n* **Logo**: High-contrast geometric `AM` monogram with cyber-cyan glow, leading to `/`.\n* **Sticky Header**: `sticky top-0 z-50` with dynamic scroll detection:\n  * Rest state: `bg-[#06080C]/75` with `backdrop-blur-sm` and subtle `border-white/[0.05]`.\n  * Scrolled state: Elevates to `bg-[#06080C]/90` with `backdrop-blur-md` and shadow elevation.\n\n#### 2. Navigation Links & CTA\n* **Links**:\n  * **Explore** (`/explore`)\n  * **AI Finder** (`/ai-finder`) — with `Smart Match` badge and pulsing AI sparkle icon\n  * **Compare** (`/compare`)\n  * **Price Predictor** (`/price-predictor`) — with `ML` badge\n  * **AI Assistant** (`/ai-assistant`) — with `Gemini` badge\n* **CTA Button**: `\"Find My Car\"` in high-contrast cyan with hover spring physics leading to `/ai-finder`.\n\n#### 3. Smooth Micro-Interactions & Active State\n* **Active Link Pill**: Dynamic route detection using `usePathname()` with a Framer Motion `layoutId=\"navbar-active\"` pill background and cyan bottom glow line.\n* **Hover Indicator**: Spring-animated `layoutId=\"navbar-hover\"` pill on desktop link hover.\n\n#### 4. Responsive Mobile Drawer & Keyboard Accessibility\n* **Mobile Toggle**: Accessible hamburger icon with animated `Menu` $\\leftrightarrow$ `X` transition.\n* **Mobile Drawer**: Animated slide-down drawer with backdrop overlay, contextual route descriptions, badges, and a full-width `\"Find My Car\"` CTA button.\n* **Accessibility**: Full `aria-label`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`, `aria-current=\"page\"`, scroll-lock when open, and Escape key dismissal.\n\n---\n\n### Files Created / Modified\n* [`frontend/components/layout/navbar.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/layout/navbar.tsx) — Main Navbar component.\n* [`frontend/components/layout/index.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/layout/index.ts) — Layout barrel export.\n* [`frontend/lib/constants/navigation.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/lib/constants/navigation.ts) — Navigation route map and CTA constants.\n* [`frontend/app/layout.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/layout.tsx) — Root layout mounting `<Navbar />`.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n* **TypeScript Typecheck (`npx tsc --noEmit`)**: **0 errors**\n* **Next.js Production Build (`npm run build`)**: **Compiled successfully with all static pages optimized**\n\nThe updated walkthrough is available in the [Walkthrough Artifact](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/brain/10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1/walkthrough.md)."}
