{"step_index":258,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T19:19:43Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough update including the AutoMind AI cinematic full-screen hero section, Framer Motion animations, telemetry HUD, central vehicle visual, and build verification.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# AutoMind AI — Homepage Hero Section Walkthrough\n\n## Summary of Completed Work\n\nThe full-screen cinematic **Homepage Hero Section** for **AutoMind AI** has been implemented in [`frontend/components/home/hero-section.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/home/hero-section.tsx) and mounted in [`frontend/app/page.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/page.tsx).\n\n---\n\n## 1. Hero Section Design & Technical Specs\n\n### Typography & Structure\n- **Headline**: `\"THE FUTURE OF MOBILITY\"` with high-contrast gradient chrome and cyan glow drop-shadow.\n- **Supporting Text**: `\"AI-powered intelligence for the way you drive.\"`\n- **Primary CTA**: `\"Explore Cars\"` (cyan glowing button with right arrow icon $\\rightarrow$ `/explore`).\n- **Secondary CTA**: `\"AI Car Finder\"` (frosted glass button with pulsing cyan sparkle icon $\\rightarrow$ `/ai-finder`).\n- **Telemetry Eyebrow**: `LiveBadge` with animated beacon indicating `\"Next-Gen Automotive Platform\"`.\n\n### Central Vehicle Visual & Atmospheric Lighting\n- **Atmospheric Depth**: Top radial cyan spotlight cone, ground reflection light plate, and pulsing ambient backlight.\n- **Precision Vehicle Vector**: Aerodynamic silhouette contour, cockpit canopy glass reflections, carbon fiber splitter and rear wing, matrix laser headlights (cyan glow), and OLED tail lamps (crimson glow).\n- **Floating Animation**: Gentle physics-based hovering/breathing motion (`y: [0, -8, 0]`, 5.5s loop).\n- **Telemetry Overlays**:\n  - Left HUD Card: `0-60 MPH // 2.8s (Launch Control)`\n  - Right HUD Card: `PEAK POWERTRAIN // 750 HP • Dual-Motor AWD`\n  - Bottom Spec Ribbon: `Active Torque Vectoring`, `800V Architecture`, `380 mi EPA`, `AI Confidence: 98.4%`.\n\n### Micro-Interactions & Scroll Indicator\n- **Text & Element Entrance**: Staggered slide-up and fade-in animations with custom cubic-bezier easing (`[0.16, 1, 0.3, 1]`).\n- **Scroll Indicator**: Bottom center animated mouse wheel with smooth scroll trigger to the next section.\n- **Responsiveness**: Fluid layout adapting across mobile, tablet, and widescreen viewports.\n\n---\n\n## 2. File Manifest\n\n- [`frontend/components/home/hero-section.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/home/hero-section.tsx) — Full-screen cinematic Hero section with Framer Motion animations.\n- [`frontend/components/home/index.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/home/index.ts) — Home components barrel export.\n- [`frontend/app/page.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/page.tsx) — Homepage rendering the Hero Section.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Verification Results\n\n| Test | Tool | Result |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **TypeScript Typecheck** | `npx tsc --noEmit` | **0 errors** |\n| **Next.js Production Build** | `npm run build` | **Compiled successfully, static optimization passed** |\n","Description":"Update walkthrough artifact for Hero section implementation","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\chauh\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
